@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #2980B9
  BackgroundColor #3498DB
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  FontSize 14
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam participant {
  BorderColor #2C3E50
  BackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  FontColor #2C3E50
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #8E44AD
  BackgroundColor #E8DAEF
  FontColor #8E44AD
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam collections {
  BorderColor #D35400
  BackgroundColor #FAD7A0
  FontColor #D35400
  FontSize 12
}

title "sd-01 — Place Order (Happy Path)"

actor "Parent" as Parent
participant "Next.js Frontend\n(Vercel)" as FE
participant ".NET API\n(MonsterASP)" as API
database "MS SQL\nServer" as DB
collections "Hangfire\nJob Queue" as HF
actor "SMTP\n(Gmail)" as SMTP

Parent -> FE: Checkout form submit\n(name, phone, email, address, items)
activate FE

FE -> API: POST /api/v1/orders\n{ channel, customer, items }
activate API

API -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB

API -> DB: SELECT stock, price_incl_vat\nFROM variant\nWITH (UPDLOCK, ROWLOCK)\nWHERE id = ?
note right: Row locked for\ntx duration. Prevents\nconcurrent oversell.

DB --> API: { stock, price }

API -> API: Check stock >= qty\nfor each variant

== Stock OK ==

API -> DB: INSERT orders\n(state='placed', token_hash,\ncustomer fields, total)

API -> DB: INSERT order_items\n(variant_id, qty,\nunit_price_snapshot,\nline_total_snapshot)

API -> DB: UPDATE variant\nSET stock = stock - qty\nWHERE id = ?

API -> DB: INSERT audit_log\n(action='order.created',\nactor='parent')

API -> DB: COMMIT
note right: Stock atomically\ndeducted. Token URL\ngenerated in API.

deactivate DB

API -> HF: Enqueue Job:\nSendOrderConfirmationEmail

API --> FE: 201 Created\n{ orderId, token, trackingUrl, total }
deactivate API

FE --> Parent: Confirmation page\n"Save this link to track\nyour order"
deactivate FE

== Later (async via Hangfire) ==

HF -> API: Dequeue & process job
activate API

API -> SMTP: Send order-confirmation\nemail with token URL
activate SMTP
SMTP --> API: 200 OK
deactivate SMTP

API -> DB: INSERT email_log\n(template='order_confirmation',\nstatus='sent')
deactivate API

@enduml
